.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH snip-keys-export 1  "snip 0.6.0" 
.SH NAME
snip\-keys\-export \- Write the built\-in bindings as an authoritative keys.toml
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsnip keys export\fR [\fB\-\-library\fR] [\fB\-\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-simplified\-ui\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write the built\-in bindings as an authoritative keys.toml
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-library\fR \fI<LIBRARY>\fR
Library root. Falls back to SNIP_LIBRARY, ancestor discovery, then config
.TP
\fB\-\-mode\fR \fI<MODE>\fR
Export only one mode
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
global
.IP \(bu 2
sidebar
.IP \(bu 2
list
.IP \(bu 2
preview
.IP \(bu 2
fragment
.IP \(bu 2
fragment\-grab
.IP \(bu 2
trash
.IP \(bu 2
help
.IP \(bu 2
git
.IP \(bu 2
gist
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Overwrite an existing keys.toml
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Structured output mode for commands that return records
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
human
.IP \(bu 2
json
.IP \(bu 2
jsonl
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<COLOR>\fR
Color policy for terminal preview
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-simplified\-ui\fR[=\fI<BOOL>\fR]
Use square TUI bars without Powerline font glyphs for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
true
.IP \(bu 2
false
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
